CFLAGS=-O2 -pipe -g
CPUTYPE?=ev56

helped - it now spits out reams of unaligned accesses and a large
number of "junk pointer in free() - too high" messages and finally
dies with a segmentation violation in FcCharSetDestroy() trying to
